          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="Humans outcome">
            <div class="type-heading-lg case-lead-prose">
              <p>The result is a concept for a more expressive Humans product: bright, energetic and human, but still grounded in everyday utility. The work created a direction for how the app, website and category system could speak the same language — turning a complex mix of telecom, banking and marketplace features into a clearer and more emotional digital experience.</p>
            </div>
